              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Marathi for to pray, then the Marathi for to recommend."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: उसने घेणे",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "उसने घेणे — usne gheṇe — \"to borrow\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The origin of उसने, \"on loan\", is not settled: neither CDIAL nor DEDR has an entry for it. घेणे comes from Sanskrit gṛbhāyati, \"takes, seizes\" (CDIAL 4236)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for this chapter."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
